[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]历代评价[/font][/b]


[indent]•  [color=#000000]崔琰[/color]（《三国志·魏志十二》裴注引）：「孙疏亮亢烈，刚简能断；卢（毓）清警明理，百炼不消。皆公才也。」[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]陈寿[/color]：「孙礼刚断伉厉；[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "王观", "cat": "people"}]王观[/url][/color]清劲贞白。咸克致公辅。」[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]郝经[/color]（《郝氏续后汉书》）：「孙礼蹇蹇抗直不挠，王观劲挺清亮，并有王臣之风。亦坠懿术中，与之共事，其智不足称也。」[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]王夫之[/color]（《读通鉴论·卷十》）：列孙礼为魏朝极言无讳的正直大臣之一，与[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "陈群", "cat": "people"}]陈群[/url][/color]、辛毗、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "蒋济", "cat": "people"}]蒋济[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "高堂隆", "cat": "people"}]高堂隆[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "高柔", "cat": "people"}]高柔[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "杨阜", "cat": "people"}]杨阜[/url][/color]、杜恕、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "陈矫", "cat": "people"}]陈矫[/url][/color]、卫觊、王肃、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "卫臻", "cat": "people"}]卫臻[/url][/color]、董寻、张茂并举，称其「极言无讳，不避丧亡之谤诅，至于叩棺待死以求伸」。[/indent]
